{"step_index":184,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-09-30T00:53:10Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-30T09:53:10+09:00\nTool is running as a background task with task id: d0ec53e0-5d72-4d0e-894d-f2b58c54bcfd/task-184\nTask Description: & \"C:\\Users\\lg\\.local\\bin\\python3.11.exe\" -c \"\nimport openpyxl, sys\nsys.stdout.reconfigure(encoding='utf-8')\n\ntarget_p = r'C:\\Users\\lg\\Desktop\\Today\\(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑_배현명.xlsx'\nbackup_p = r'C:\\Users\\lg\\Desktop\\Today\\(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑_배현명__BACKUP_20260921_090440.xlsx'\n\nwb_t = openpyxl.load_workbook(target_p, data_only=True)\nwb_b = openpyxl.load_workbook(backup_p, data_only=True)\n\nws_t = wb_t['기업체 리스트']\nws_b = wb_b['기업체 리스트']\n\nheaders = [ws_t.cell(1, c).value for c in range(1, ws_t.max_column+1)]\n\nnew_values = []\ncleared_values = []\nmodified_values = []\n\nfor r in range(2, max(ws_t.max_row, ws_b.max_row)+1):\n    for c in range(1, max(ws_t.max_column, ws_b.max_column)+1):\n        vt = ws_t.cell(r, c).value\n        vb = ws_b.cell(r, c).value\n        st = str(vt).strip() if vt is not None else ''\n        sb = str(vb).strip() if vb is not None else ''\n        if st != sb:\n            cell = ws_t.cell(r, c)\n            is_red = False\n            if cell.font and cell.font.color and str(cell.font.color.rgb) in ['FFFF0000', 'FFFF3300', 'FFED0000']:\n                is_red = True\n            if not is_red:\n                company = ws_t.cell(r, 3).value\n                if sb == '' and st != '':\n                    new_values.append((r, company, c, headers[c-1], vb, vt))\n                elif sb != '' and st == '':\n                    cleared_values.append((r, company, c, headers[c-1], vb, vt))\n                else:\n                    modified_values.append((r, company, c, headers[c-1], vb, vt))\n\nprint(f'NON-RED diffs summary:')\nprint(f'  Newly entered (was blank -> now has value): {len(new_values)}')\nprint(f'  Modified (was X -> now Y): {len(modified_values)}')\nprint(f'  Cleared/Deleted (was X -> now blank): {len(cleared_values)}')\n\nprint('\\n--- ALL Newly entered cells (Sample 30) ---')\nfor r, comp, c, h, vb, vt in new_values[:30]:\n    print(f'  Row {r:4d} [{comp}] Col {c:2d} ({h}): {repr(vb)} -> {repr(vt)}')\n\nprint('\\n--- ALL Modified cells (Total {}) ---'.format(len(modified_values)))\nfor r, comp, c, h, vb, vt in modified_values:\n    print(f'  Row {r:4d} [{comp}] Col {c:2d} ({h}): {repr(vb)} -> {repr(vt)}')\n\nprint('\\n--- Cleared cells (Sample 15) ---')\nfor r, comp, c, h, vb, vt in cleared_values[:15]:\n    print(f'  Row {r:4d} [{comp}] Col {c:2d} ({h}): {repr(vb)} -> {repr(vt)}')\n\"\nTask logs are available at: file:///C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/d0ec53e0-5d72-4d0e-894d-f2b58c54bcfd/.system_generated/tasks/task-184.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\n DO NOTHING ELSE."}
